                <pb facs="0402" n="337" sameAs="frus:frus1936v03/pg337"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123H875/188: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-01T11:00:00-05:00">December 1, 1936—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>167. Your 498, November 30, 5 p.m. Please advise Foreign Office of Hughes’
                    assignment to Addis Ababa in consular capacity and request telegraphic
                    authorization to Italian Embassy here to grant him visa.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
